    "name": "Restful Booker - Full CRUD + Auth",
    "description": "Full test collection for https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com\n\nEndpoints covered:\n  Auth    : POST /auth               (create token)\n  Ping    : GET  /ping               (health check)\n  Booking : GET  /booking            (list all IDs)\n  Booking : GET  /booking?filters    (filter by name/date)\n  Booking : GET  /booking/:id        (get single)\n  Booking : POST /booking            (create - REAL persistence)\n  Booking : PUT  /booking/:id        (full replace - needs token)\n  Booking : PATCH /booking/:id       (partial update - needs token)\n  Booking : DELETE /booking/:id      (delete - needs token)\n  Booking : GET  /booking/:id (404)  (verify deleted)\n\nAuth Strategy: Token passed via Cookie header (token=<value>).\nToken is auto-saved to environment by the CreateToken request.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "54528412",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/54528412-2c5dccae-1225-4ae0-a9e5-9cbd1256bb06?source=collection_link"
  },
